            <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);">
              ⚡ WASM C ENGINE READY
            </span>
